<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  :root {
    --ks-beige: #F5F5DC;
    --ks-gray: #D3D3D3;
    --ks-dark: #333333;
    --ks-white: #ffffff;
    --ks-softwhite: #fffdf7;
  }

  body {
    background: var(--ks-beige) !important;
    color: var(--ks-dark) !important;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }

  .ks-frame {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    background: var(--ks-white);
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 25px);
    border: 12px solid var(--ks-beige);
    outline: 4px solid var(--ks-gray);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  /* ARTICLE AREA */
  .ks-article {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ks-left {
    flex: 1 1 45%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ks-left img {
    max-width: 100%;
    border: 2px solid var(--ks-gray);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .ks-thumbs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ks-thumbs img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--ks-gray);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: 0.25s ease;
    display: block;
  }

  .ks-thumbs img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ks-right {
    flex: 1 1 45%;
  }

  .ks-title {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  /* DYNAMIC HIGHLIGHTS */
  .ks-usp-grid {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .ks-usp-item {
    background: var(--ks-softwhite);
    border: 1px solid var(--ks-gray);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* TABS / BUTTONS */
  .ks-tabs { display: none; }

  /* Stacked sections */
  .ks-section {
    margin-top: 20px;
    background: var(--ks-softwhite);
    border: 1px solid var(--ks-gray);
    padding: clamp(14px, 3vw, 18px);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .ks-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 3.5vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* MOBILE FIX */
  @media(max-width: 768px) {
    .ks-article { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .ks-left, .ks-right { flex: 1 1 100%; }
    .ks-thumbs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .ks-frame { border-width: 8px; outline-width: 3px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .ks-usp-item { font-weight: 600; }
    a[style] { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 18px !important; }
  }
</style>


<!-- FRAME START -->
<div class="ks-frame">

  <!-- PRODUCT AREA -->
  <div class="ks-article">

    <!-- LEFT: IMAGES -->
    <div class="ks-left">
      <img src="{DefaultProductImage}" width="700px" height="700px">

      <div class="ks-thumbs">
        {for images step=2}
          {for Images count=2 start={position}}
            <img src="{images.Source}" width="400px" height="400px">
          {/for}
        {/for}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT: TITLE + DESCRIPTION + USP -->
    <div class="ks-right">

      <div class="ks-title">{Title}</div>

      <p>{Subtitle}</p>
      <p>{Description}</p>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- BUTTON TABS removed for stacked layout -->


  <!-- STACKED CONTENT SECTIONS -->

  <section class="ks-section">
    <h2>Warum Kreativschicht?</h2>
    <p>
      Wir sind ein kleines Familienprojekt &ndash; mit echter Liebe zum Detail.
      Jedes Produkt w&auml;hlen wir bewusst aus:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>&#x2702;&#xFE0F; Kreatives &amp; Handgemachtes &ndash; erstellt von meiner Frau</li>
      <li>&#x1F41D; Imkerprodukte aus eigener Hobbyimkerei</li>
      <li>&#x1F527; Elektronik &amp; 3D-Druck &ndash; gepr&uuml;ft &amp; ausgew&auml;hlt von mir</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Wir verkaufen nur Artikel, von denen wir selbst &uuml;berzeugt sind &ndash;
      keine Massenware, sondern ehrliche, sorgf&auml;ltig kuratierte Produkte.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="ks-section">
    <h2>Versand & Rechnung</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Schneller Versand: 2&ndash;4 Werktage</li>
      <li>Sauber &amp; sicher verpackt</li>
      <li>Nachhaltige Verpackung, wo m&ouml;glich</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="ks-section">
    <h2>Shop speichern</h2>
    <p>Folge unserem Shop, um keine neuen Produkte zu verpassen!</p>
     <a href="https://www.ebay.de/usr/{EbayUserID}"
       style="padding:12px 20px; display:inline-block; border-radius:10px; background:var(--ks-dark); color:var(--ks-beige); text-decoration:none; border:2px solid var(--ks-gray); font-weight:bold;">
       &#x2764;&#xFE0F; Kreativschicht folgen
    </a>
  </section>

</div>